            <h2 style="font-size:38px; line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:-0.02em; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 16px;">The same insight, without per-domain pricing.</h2>
            <p style="font-size:var(--text-body-lg); line-height:1.5; color:var(--gray-700); margin:0;">Hosted DMARC platforms charge by the domain and by the message volume — which punishes exactly the agencies with the most to monitor.</p>
